**Time/Space:** O(n) / O(1)

**Pitfall:** The top is one past the last index — don't return the cost of landing on the last step.

**Pattern:** Linear DP (take / skip)

**Key insight:** best(i) = max(best(i-1), best(i-2) + nums[i]).

**Java**

```java
class Solution {
    public int rob(int[] nums) {
        int prev = 0, cur = 0;
        for (int x : nums) { int t = Math.max(cur, prev + x); prev = cur; cur = t; }
        return cur;
    }
}
```

