**Pitfall:** Answers must be written back in the original query order.

**Pattern:** Transpose + reverse rows

**Key insight:** Clockwise rotation = transpose across the main diagonal, then mirror each row.

**Java**

```java
class Solution {
    public void rotate(int[][] m) {
        int n = m.length;
        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++)
            for (int j = i + 1; j < n; j++) { int t = m[i][j]; m[i][j] = m[j][i]; m[j][i] = t; }
        for (int[] row : m)
            for (int l = 0, r = n - 1; l < r; l++, r--) { int t = row[l]; row[l] = row[r]; row[r] = t; }
    }
}
```

